            and awaited tickets, and its end waits (Actors R8); other identities of the same step still land (WriteAhead
            I23 amended). Why: no record names another identity, and skipping the whole step would make every persisted
            send wait on one bad actor. Reverse: skip the step's whole capture. Also Actors R23: only the disposal's own
